WEBVTT

00:14:29.922 --> 00:14:31.561
methane gas.

00:14:31.585 --> 00:14:34.986
The gas gives three to four
hours cooking a day --

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:38.650
clean, smokeless and free for the family.

00:14:38.674 --> 00:14:43.818
(Applause)

00:14:43.842 --> 00:14:46.726
I put it to you:
is this eliminating poverty?

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:51.162
And the answer from the Nepali team
who's working at the minute would say,

00:14:51.186 --> 00:14:52.337
don't be ridiculous --

00:14:52.361 --> 00:14:54.433
we have three million
more toilets to build

00:14:54.457 --> 00:14:57.308
before we can even make
a stab at that claim.

00:14:57.332 --> 00:15:00.291
And I don't pretend anything else.